      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, i get the whole ethics thing, but this is a competitive tournament, not a classroom discussion. to win, you have to know how to dismantle the opponent's position. if my student can't handle the harshest criticisms, they're gonna lose. just give me the most aggressive, hard-hitting arguments against UBI. what are the biggest flaws in their logic that they can't easily explain away?",
